      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BLACK MARVEL (1) jumped from the inside and boxed on well to finish third last time, beaten 1.3 lengths (28.44) behind Rhythmic Energy at this track. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Makes plenty of appeal. GREYSYND BONNIE (4) has a moderate overall strike-rate. Finished in the minors latest when second (28.70) at this track and may be close to breaking through. Form here at the trip sound including two wins. Expected to be in the finish again. VIKING RULER (3) broke from a low draw and filled a minor placing last start, beaten only 1.5 lengths (30.03) behind Pepper Pie at Sandown. Leading chance. HAPPY DAD (2) has definite claims at his first try at this circuit.",
